Nina smiles.
"Wait a moment," she says.
She goes out the door.
Her flat is right next door.
A little later, she comes back.
She has a gift for me.
It is a small, green plant.
"Welcome to your new home," says Nina.
She gives me the plant.
"Thanks a lot," I say.
I am very happy with my gift.
I go over to the window.
I put the plant in the window.
Now a nice plant stands in my window.
